 ## Background
-The Line Segment-based Transformer was proposed in the paper "Structure-Aware Sparse-View X-Ray 3D Reconstruction" (SAX-NeRF) by Cai Yuanhao et al., presented at CVPR 2024 [S1]. It was developed to address the limitations of existing NeRF algorithms in capturing structural contents of imaged objects in sparse-view X-ray tomography. The method is part of a framework that also includes a Masked Local-Global (MLG) ray sampling strategy and utilizes the X3D dataset [S1].
